™</div></div></div></div><div class="frame-1321318826"><div class="step-43"><div class="frame-1321318816 less-gap"><div class="text-37">Set up sequences</div><div class="text-37">Send emails &amp; LinkedIn messages</div><div class="text-37">Monitor &amp; manage replies</div><div class="text-37">Track &amp; analyze performance</div></div></div></div><div class="frame-1321318826"><div class="step-44"><div class="frame-1321318828"><div class="text-37">Reply to emails &amp; LinkedIn messages</div><div class="text-37">Schedule follow ups across channels</div><div class="text-37">Book meetings and calls</div></div></div></div><div class="step-45"><div class="text-39">Pipeline</div></div><div class="step-45 no-border"><div class="text-39">Close the Deal</div></div></div><div class="tabel_row2 _2nd"><div id="w-node-_75b3bfdf-f93b-e3a1-ad98-9fefe92b1a58-bfcf86ab" class="frame-1321318829"><div class="backgroundborder-3"><div class="container-49"><div data-w-id="75b3bfdf-f93b-e3a1-ad98-9fefe92b1a5b" class="text-38">With the Forge</div></div></div><a data-w-id="75b3bfdf-f93b-e3a1-ad98-9fefe92b1a5d" href="https://leadsforge.ai" target="_blank" class="step-49-leadsforge w-inline-block"><div data-w-id="75b3bfdf-f93b-e3a1-ad98-9fefe92b1a5e" class="home-illu-logo-box"><div class="vectors-wrapper-37-copy w-embed"><svg width="140" height="24" viewBox="0 0 140 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
