</svg></div></div></a></div></div><div class="text-xregular-15 text-dark">Warmforge automatically builds and protects your sender reputation using a premium warm-up pool that excludes bad actors and disallows any external SMTP vendors from entering the ecosystem. The moment your infrastructure is connected, Warmforge begins strengthening deliverability by warming your mailboxes, monitoring domain and inbox health, scoring reputation, running inbox placement tests, and alerting you to issues before they impact performance. Because the pool is clean, controlled, and fully internal, your warm-up environment stays stable - and the rest of your outreach stays healthy and reliable.</div></div></div></div></div><div class="stack-timeline-parent"><div class="stack-timeline-left-parent"><div class="stack-timeline-left"><div class="stack-timeline-circle"><div class="text-semibold text-white">3</div></div></div></div><div class="stack-timeline-right"><div class="stack-timeline-right-top"><div class="stack-timeline-right-top-badge"><div class="baseline-0 w-embed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
