<path d="M5.83594 14.1667L14.1693 5.83337M14.1693 5.83337H5.83594M14.1693 5.83337V14.1667" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
</svg></div></div></a></div></div><div class="text-xregular-15 text-dark">Leadsforge is a chat-based engine that builds highly targeted, enriched lead lists in minutes - no technical skills needed. It goes far beyond basic data pulls: you can generate lookalike audiences, extract competitor followers directly through the software, qualify leads using intent signals, and surface key buying indicators before outreach even begins. The data is extremely affordable, and Leadsforge includes two standout advantages you won’t find elsewhere: the cheapest mobile number data on the market and true competitor-follower extraction at scale. Every list can be refined, segmented, enriched, and exported straight into Salesforge or CSV, giving you fast, accurate, and signal-rich data ready for immediate outreach.</div></div></div></div></div><div class="stack-timeline-parent"><div class="stack-timeline-left-parent"><div class="stack-timeline-left"><div class="stack-timeline-circle"><div class="text-semibold text-white">4</div></div></div></div><div class="stack-timeline-right"><div class="stack-timeline-right-top"><div class="stack-timeline-right-top-badge"><div class="baseline-0 w-embed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
