<path d="M5.83594 14.1667L14.1693 5.83337M14.1693 5.83337H5.83594M14.1693 5.83337V14.1667" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
</svg></div></div></a></div></div><div class="text-xregular-15 text-dark">Salesforge is the command center of the entire Stack - the hub where infrastructure, warm-up data, lead lists, and every communication channel converge for your whole team. Inside Salesforge, you can launch and manage multi-channel sequences that blend email and LinkedIn outreach into one cohesive workflow. Your team can personalize messaging at scale, automate timing across touchpoints, track performance in real time, jump into conversations instantly, and book meetings without ever leaving the interface.<br/><br/>With unlimited mailboxes and unlimited LinkedIn senders, teams using Salesforge with the correct setup routinely see reply rates between 10% and 30%, even at scale. There’s no tab-hopping between inboxes or LinkedIn accounts, and no need for separate tools to manage replies - everything flows through one unified system built for high-volume, high-quality outbound.<br/><br/>Primebox™ centralizes all email responses across every mailbox you use, and LinkedIn actions and replies surface in the same command center. Whether you’re sending from Mailforge, Infraforge, Primeforge, or external mailboxes - and whether your touchpoints are email or LinkedIn - Salesforge keeps everything unified, visible, and easy to manage.</div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="padding-global"><div class="container-large"><div class="stack-timeline-parent"><div class="stack-timeline-left-parent"><div class="stack-timeline-left"><div class="stack-timeline-circle"><div class="text-semibold text-white">5</div></div></div></div><div class="stack-timeline-right"><div class="stack-timeline-right-top"><div class="stack-timeline-right-top-badge"><div class="baseline-0 w-embed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
  <rect width="24" height="24" fill="#F4EBFF" rx="4"/>
  <path stroke="#6E40D7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M9.333 15.333h5.334m-3.322-9.49L6.824 9.359c-.303.236-.454.353-.563.5-.096.13-.168.277-.212.434-.049.176-.049.368-.049.75v4.824c0 .746 0 1.12.145 1.405.128.25.332.455.583.583.285.145.659.145 1.405.145h7.734c.746 0 1.12 0 1.405-.145a1.34 1.34 0 0 0 .583-.583c.145-.285.145-.659.145-1.405v-4.824c0-.382 0-.574-.05-.75a1.332 1.332 0 0 0-.211-.434c-.11-.147-.26-.264-.563-.5l-4.521-3.516c-.234-.183-.351-.274-.48-.309a.667.667 0 0 0-.35 0c-.128.035-.246.127-.48.309Z"/>
</svg></div><div class="text-small-14 text-medium text-dark">Autonomous Sales Layer</div></div><h3 class="heading-style-h5 text-medium">AI SDR Automation</h3></div><div><div class="n-home-feature-left-bottom stack-product"><div class="div-block-136"><div class="div-block-137"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/642bd4ac1fcf21f9f33d92ed/67e12ab014062170f3eb6122_Af-menu-image.avif" loading="lazy" alt="" class="icon-embed _28px"/><h4 class="text-semibold text-dark">Agent Frank</h4></div><a href="https://www.salesforge.ai/agent/frank" target="_blank" class="stack-product-button af w-inline-block"><div class="text-small-14 text-semibold text-dark">Meet Agent Frank</div><div class="eco-table-icon-box stack-apge"><div class="icon-embed w-embed"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M5.83594 14.1667L14.1693 5.83337M14.1693 5.83337H5.83594M14.1693 5.83337V14.1667" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
</svg></div></div></a></div><div class="text-xregular-15 text-dark">Agent Frank works around the clock and handles the entire SDR workflow from start to finish. Once configured, he taps into every Forge product behind the scenes without requiring any extra setup from you. Frank finds prospects, enriches and verifies their data, crafts authentic outreach, sends follow-ups, manages replies, and books meetings - all automatically. You define his buyer persona, goals, ICP, and operating rules, and he takes over the execution: from outreach to reply handling. Frank gives you a fully autonomous SDR engine that never slows down and never needs a break.</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><div class="divider lighter"></div><section class="section-n-stack-paths"><div class="padding-global"><div class="container-large"><div class="stack-paths-parent-wrap"><div class="container-small"><h2 class="heading-style-h4 text-align-center margin-bottom _16px text-medium">3 Paths to Acquire Customers With the Forge Stack</h2><div class="container-xxsmall"><div class="text-dark text-align-center">Run outbound yourself, let our AI SDR do it for you, or work with experts who already know the playbook. Same stack. Different execution.</div></div></div><div class="container-large"><div class="stack-paths-grid"><div class="stack-paths-item"><div class="_3-paths-heading-badge"><h3 class="text-large-20 text-medium text-white">Your Team</h3></div><div class="text-dark text-align-center text-xregular-15 text-semibold">You own the strategy. Your team runs the plays. The Forge handles the infrastructure.</div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/642bd4ac1fcf21f9f33d92ed/694e8deade9867a69fcfb648_paths-01.avif" loading="lazy" width="480" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, 480px" alt="" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/642bd4ac1fcf21f9f33d92ed/694e8deade9867a69fcfb648_paths-01-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/642bd4ac1fcf21f9f33d92ed/694e8deade9867a69fcfb648_paths-01-p-800.png 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/642bd4ac1fcf21f9f33d92ed/694e8deade9867a69fcfb648_paths-01.avif 960w" class="stack-paths-image"/><div class="text-dark text-align-center text-xregular-15">This path is for teams that want full control over messaging, targeting, and daily execution - without dealing with inbox setup, deliverability issues, or tool sprawl.</div><div class="text-dark text-align-center text-xregular-15 margin-top _24px text-semibold">Best for:</div><div class="_3-paths-badges-wrapper"><div class="ambassador-badge-line-wrapper margin-top _16px"><div class="ambassador-badge white"><div class="text-dark text-medium text-small-14 text-align-center">Sales teams scaling outbound internally</div></div><div class="ambassador-badge white"><div class="text-dark text-medium text-small-14 text-align-center">Founders who want hands-on control</div></div><div class="ambassador-badge white"><div class="text-dark text-medium text-small-14 text-align-center">Teams replacing fragile point tools with one system</div></div></div><div class="margin-top _16px"><a data-wf--button--variant="primary---m-48px" href="https://app.salesforge.ai/signup" class="n-button w-inline-block"><div>Dive Deeper</div></a></div></div></div><div class="stack-paths-item _2"><div class="_3-paths-heading-badge _2"><h3 class="text-large-20 text-medium text-white">Agent Frank</h3></div><div class="text-dark text-align-center text-xregular-15 text-semibold">No SDRs. No daily ops. Just meetings booked.</div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/642bd4ac1fcf21f9f33d92ed/694e8dea08a404815ad72284_paths-02.avif" loading="lazy" width="480" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, 480px" alt="" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/642bd4ac1fcf21f9f33d92ed/694e8dea08a404815ad72284_paths-02-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/642bd4ac1fcf21f9f33d92ed/694e8dea08a404815ad72284_paths-02-p-800.png 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/642bd4ac1fcf21f9f33d92ed/694e8dea08a404815ad72284_paths-02.avif 960w" class="stack-paths-image"/><div class="text-dark text-align-center text-xregular-15">Agent Frank runs outbound end-to-end using the Forge Stack - finding prospects, personalizing outreach, following up, and booking meetings automatically.</div><div class="text-dark text-align-center text-xregular-15 margin-top _24px text-semibold">Best for:</div><div class="_3-paths-badges-wrapper"><div class="ambassador-badge-line-wrapper margin-top _16px"><div class="ambassador-badge white"><div class="text-dark text-medium text-small-14 text-align-center">Lean teams that want results without hiring SDRs</div></div><div class="ambassador-badge white"><div class="text-dark text-medium text-small-14 text-align-center">Founders who don’t want to manage outbound</div></div><div class="ambassador-badge white"><div class="text-dark text-medium text-small-14 text-align-center">Companies that want speed without operational overhead</div></div></div><div class="margin-top _16px"><a data-wf--button--variant="primary---m-48px" href="/agent/frank" class="n-button w-inline-block"><div>Hire Agent Frank</div></a></div></div></div><div class="stack-paths-item _3"><div class="_3-paths-heading-badge _3"><h3 class="text-large-20 text-medium text-white">Forge Expert</h3></div><div class="text-dark text-align-center text-xregular-15 text-semibold">Done-for-you outbound, built on the same stack used by top operators.</div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/642bd4ac1fcf21f9f33d92ed/694e8deaf7c8dbcab56a2723_efe624b058ee36eb0b61bbcdf6f0649b_paths-03.avif" loading="lazy" width="444" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, 444px" alt="" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/642bd4ac1fcf21f9f33d92ed/694e8deaf7c8dbcab56a2723_efe624b058ee36eb0b61bbcdf6f0649b_paths-03-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/642bd4ac1fcf21f9f33d92ed/694e8deaf7c8dbcab56a2723_efe624b058ee36eb0b61bbcdf6f0649b_paths-03-p-800.png 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/642bd4ac1fcf21f9f33d92ed/694e8deaf7c8dbcab56a2723_efe624b058ee36eb0b61bbcdf6f0649b_paths-03.avif 888w" class="stack-paths-image"/><div class="text-dark text-align-center text-xregular-15">Forge Experts are vetted agencies that run outbound for you using the Forge Stack - so you get expertise, execution, and scale without building it in-house.</div><div class="text-dark text-align-center text-xregular-15 margin-top _24px text-semibold">Best for:</div><div class="_3-paths-badges-wrapper"><div class="ambassador-badge-line-wrapper margin-top _16px"><div class="ambassador-badge white"><div class="text-dark text-medium text-small-14 text-align-center">Teams that want fast traction without internal ramp-up</div></div><div class="ambassador-badge white"><div class="text-dark text-medium text-small-14 text-align-center">Companies outsourcing outbound to specialists</div></div><div class="ambassador-badge white"><div class="text-dark text-medium text-small-14 text-align-center">Leaders who want results without managing a team</div></div></div><div class="margin-top _16px"><a data-wf--button--variant="primary---m-48px" href="/experts" class="n-button w-inline-block"><div>Speak With a Forge Expert</div></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><div class="divider lighter"></div><section id="stack" class="n-section-divider"><div class="padding-global"><div class="container-large"><div class="n-section-home-divider-inner"></div></div></div></section><div class="divider lighter"></div><section class="section-n-stack-paths"><div class="padding-global"><div class="container-large"><div class="stack-why-use"><div class="container-small"><h2 class="heading-style-h4 text-medium margin-bottom _16px">Why Use the Forge Stack Instead of Individual Tools?</h2><div class="container-xxsmall"><div class="text-dark"><strong>Using the Forge Stack is a lot like choosing Apple over Android</strong>: everything is designed to work together natively, without hacks, plugins, or duct-taped integrations. Each Forge product speaks the same language, follows the same logic, and connects instantly with the rest of the ecosystem. You don’t need Sales Ops, RevOps, n8n, Make, or a maze of Zapier flows just to keep your outreach running - it all works out of the box.</div></div></div><div id="w-node-_0169c630-cd7e-06af-ab7a-4b1fa4376180-bfcf86ab" class="stack-why-use-right"><div class="stack-why-use-right-item"><div id="w-node-efe46d35-b3ac-3f06-89d4-1824b78ef955-bfcf86ab" class="div-block-140"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/642bd4ac1fcf21f9f33d92ed/694e9051ebc6de25b4f8cb0c_why-use-illu-01.avif" loading="lazy" width="472.5" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, 473px" alt="" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/642bd4ac1fcf21f9f33d92ed/694e9051ebc6de25b4f8cb0c_why-use-illu-01-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/642bd4ac1fcf21f9f33d92ed/694e9051ebc6de25b4f8cb0c_why-use-illu-01.avif 945w" class="image-absolute"/></div><div><h3 class="text-medium-18 text-dark text-semibold margin-bottom _12px">Everything Connects Automatically</h3><div class="text-xregular-15 text-dark">Every Forge product integrates at the system level. Infrastructure flows into warm-up, warm-up flows into lead generation, leads flow into multi-channel outreach, and all of it stays synced without you doing anything. No wrestling with APIs, no maintaining automations, no fear that one update will break your entire workflow. With the Stack, everything behaves like one product by design.</div></div></div><div class="stack-why-use-right-item"><div id="w-node-_92efa19e-fcea-c9e7-f3a2-077a68cad64b-bfcf86ab" class="div-block-140"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/642bd4ac1fcf21f9f33d92ed/694e9051aaf8efbd43106e4a_why-use-illu-02.avif" loading="lazy" width="440" alt="" class="image-absolute"/></div><div><h3 class="text-medium-18 text-dark text-semibold margin-bottom _12px">One Support Team For Everything</h3><div class="text-xregular-15 text-dark">Every Forge product integrates at the system level. Infrastructure flows into warm-up, warm-up flows into lead generation, leads flow into multi-channel outreach, and all of it stays synced without you doing anything. No wrestling with APIs, no maintaining automations, no fear that one update will break your entire workflow. With the Stack, everything behaves like one product by design.</div></div></div><div class="stack-why-use-right-item"><div id="w-node-_311e6dd3-5943-3651-b768-36db580f920c-bfcf86ab" class="div-block-140"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/642bd4ac1fcf21f9f33d92ed/694e9051b859eb55bfd0defd_why-use-illu-03.avif" loading="lazy" width="440" alt="" class="image-absolute"/></div><div><h3 class="text-medium-18 text-dark text-semibold margin-bottom _12px">Built to Eliminate Manual Work, Not Create More of It</h3><div class="text-xregular-15 text-dark">The Forge Stack removes the operational overhead that usually bogs down outbound teams. Domain setup, DNS configuration, warm-up, lead enrichment, qualification, personalization, follow-ups, reply handling, and meeting scheduling all run in the background without Sales Ops or RevOps duct-taping systems together. You can operate each component individually or let the full Stack automate your entire workflow end-to-end.</div></div></div><div class="stack-why-use-right-item"><div id="w-node-_9b7a3cb0-c659-822f-07ec-3adb07532f02-bfcf86ab" class="div-block-140"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/642bd4ac1fcf21f9f33d92ed/694e9051d54cfd3e0951a33f_why-use-illu-04.avif" loading="lazy" width="472.5" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, 473px" alt="" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/642bd4ac1fcf21f9f33d92ed/694e9051d54cfd3e0951a33f_why-use-illu-04-p-500.avif 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/642bd4ac1fcf21f9f33d92ed/694e9051d54cfd3e0951a33f_why-use-illu-04.avif 880w" class="image-absolute"/></div><div><h3 class="text-medium-18 text-dark text-semibold margin-bottom _12px">Proven Results: More Pipeline, Less Overhead</h3><div class="text-xregular-15 text-dark">Teams using the Forge consistently see stronger deliverability, higher reply rates, better positive response percentages, faster experimentation, lower CAC, and significantly broader pipeline coverage - all with a fraction of the manual effort. When everything is built to fit together, performance becomes predictable, scalable, and repeatable.</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><div class="divider lighter"></div><section class="section-case-study-preview"><div class="padding-global"><div class="container-large"><div class="case-study-parent-flex"><div id="w-node-_54c2735d-2fc2-e632-357b-823ca3ab5b37-bfcf86ab" class="case-study-left"><div class="case-study-left-top no-border"><div class="h-flex-left-center"><div data-wf--badge--variant="primary-darker" class="badge w-variant-ef5b74e5-d382-c21a-c915-aaa5baec2595"><div class="text-align-center">Case Study</div></div></div><h1 class="heading-style-h3 margin-top _12px">How Growth Alliance <span class="text-brand">Builds Scalable Outbound for $5M+ Companies</span> Using the Forge Stack</h1></div></div><div id="w-node-_54c2735d-2fc2-e632-357b-823ca3ab5b44-bfcf86ab" class="case-study-right"><div class="case-study-metadata-parent-wrapper static"><div class="case-study-logo-box"><img sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/642bd4ac1fcf21f9f33d92ed/696dd8f52a2242d444f23efb_GA%20Full%20Logo%20Gradient%20dark%20copy-p-500.avif 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/642bd4ac1fcf21f9f33d92ed/696dd8f52a2242d444f23efb_GA%20Full%20Logo%20Gradient%20dark%20copy.avif 2384w" alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/642bd4ac1fcf21f9f33d92ed/696dd8f52a2242d444f23efb_GA%20Full%20Logo%20Gradient%20dark%20copy.avif" class="case-study-logo"/><a href="https://www.unitesync.com" target="_blank" class="case-study-website-link text-small-14 text-light">growthalliance.io</a></div><div class="divider lighter"></div><div class="case-study-forge-in-use-parent-wrapper"><div class="text-small-14 text-medium">Forges used</div><a href="https://app.salesforge.ai/signup" target="_blank" class="case-study-forge-in-use-box w-inline-block"><div class="case-study-forge-logo w-embed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" height="100%" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 32 32">
  <rect width="32" height="32" fill="#6E40D7" rx="8"/>
