</svg></div></div></a><a href="https://www.warmforge.ai/" target="_blank" class="case-study-forge-in-use-box w-inline-block"><div class="case-study-forge-logo w-embed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" height="100%" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 32 32">
