<path d="M5.83594 14.1667L14.1693 5.83337M14.1693 5.83337H5.83594M14.1693 5.83337V14.1667" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
</svg></div></div></a></div><div class="divider lighter"></div><div id="case-study-email-form" data-source="SF Footer" class="case-study-email-form w-form"><form id="wf-form-Case-study-form" name="wf-form-Case-study-form" data-name="Case study form" method="post" class="case-study-email-form-elements-wrapper" data-wf-page-id="67c6e8d320cb78b1bfcf86ab" data-wf-element-id="54c2735d-2fc2-e632-357b-823ca3ab5b8f"><input class="input-hubspot _40px text-align-center w-input" maxlength="256" name="email" data-name="email" placeholder="Enter your business email" type="email" id="email" required=""/><div class="hide-desktop w-embed"><select class="input-element" name="case_study">
  <option value="UniteSync" selected>UniteSync</option>
</select>

<select name="web_form_name">
  <option value="Salesforge email capture" selected>Salesforge email capture</option>
  <option value="Leadsforge email capture">Leadsforge email capture</option>
  <option value="Primeforge email capture">Primeforge email capture</option>
  <option value="Mailforge email capture">Mailforge email capture</option>
  <option value="Infraforge email capture">Infraforge email capture</option>
  <option value="Warmforge email capture">Warmforge email capture</option>
</select></div><input type="submit" data-wait="Please wait..." class="n-button _44px text-small-14 w-button" value="Get the full case study"/></form><div class="success-message-2 w-form-done"><div class="get-ai-message-form-success-wrapper-2"><div><div class="text-semibold text-brand margin-bottom">Sent! Please check your inbox.</div></div></div></div><div class="form-error-box-2 margin-top-2 _24px w-form-fail"><div class="text-dark-2 text-align-center">Something went wrong. Please try again</div></div></div></div></div><div class="case-study-content-grid"><div class="text-dark">Growth Alliance is a revenue activation consultancy that helps $5M+ companies turn fragmented marketing operations into scalable, predictable outbound revenue engines. They don’t run campaigns. They build scalable systems. As a Forge Expert partner, Growth Alliance uses the Forge Stack as a unified outbound ecosystem - both internally and across client engagements - to design revenue engines that scale across domains, inboxes, ICPs, and teams without sacrificing deliverability or control. A key part of that transformation was consolidation: moving away from multiple disconnected platforms and standardizing outbound on one integrated stack - from infrastructure to warm-up to sending. In their own words, Growth Alliance implements unified strategies on a unified system that scales.</div><div class="case-study-quote-parent"><div class="case-study-rich-text w-richtext"><p>“<strong>Switching between tools, platforms, and contexts are the ultimate killers in efficient growth.</strong> As I&#x27;m a firm believer in scalable processes that are unified in strategy, it’s sort of a no-brainer to have everything in one place, working consistently, and have a support team that takes rapid feedback to heart.”</p></div><div class="case-study-person-wrapper in-quote"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/642bd4ac1fcf21f9f33d92ed/696dd8f581db4148da0c1fe4_1751882364502.avif" loading="lazy" alt="" class="avatar _48px"/><div class="case-study-person-text-box"><div class="text-xregular-15 text-semibold text-dark">Spencer Tahil</div><div class="text-xxsmall-13 text-light">Founder &amp; Chief Growth Officer at Growth Alliance</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section-why-us"><div class="padding-global-5"><div class="container-large"><div class="why-us-parent-wrapper"><div class="heading-badge-box medium"><div class="why-us-heading-box-2"><h2 class="heading-style-h3">Why The Forge Wins</h2></div></div><div class="why-us-content-wrapper stack-page"><div class="why-us-items-wrapper"><div class="why-us-feature-item"><div class="icon-embed-13 _56px w-embed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 56 56">

    <path fill="#F4EBFF" d="M48 0H8a8 8 0 0 0-8 8v40a8 8 0 0 0 8 8h40a8 8 0 0 0 8-8V8a8 8 0 0 0-8-8Z"/>
    <path stroke="#6E40D7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M33.33 22.666v-4l4-4 1.334 2.667 2.667 1.334-4 4h-4Zm0 0L27.998 28m13.334 0c0 7.364-5.97 13.333-13.334 13.333-7.363 0-13.333-5.97-13.333-13.333 0-7.364 5.97-13.334 13.333-13.334M34.664 28a6.667 6.667 0 1 1-6.667-6.667"/>

</svg></div><h3 class="text-large-20 text-dark text-semibold margin-top _32px">Designed By People Who Actually Run Outbound</h3><p>The Forge is built by a former VP of Sales running large sales teams, scaling agencies, and sending millions of cold messages. The workflows, guardrails, and features reflect what sellers genuinely need - not what product teams imagine sales might look like.</p></div><div class="why-us-feature-item"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/642bd4ac1fcf21f9f33d92ed/67e12ab014062170f3eb6122_Af-menu-image.avif" loading="lazy" alt="" class="icon-embed _56px"/><h3 class="text-large-20 text-dark text-semibold margin-top _32px">AI Built For Cold Outreach, Not Generic Chat</h3><p>Our AI isn’t a repurposed chatbot. It’s trained around deliverability rules, sending limits, personalization patterns, ICP matching, tone, and timing and optimized based on what works in sales, observing previous email &amp; LinkedIn performance data - all the specifics that make or break cold outreach. It writes human messages and stays within the boundaries that keep you out of spam.</p></div><div class="why-us-feature-item"><div class="icon-embed-13 _56px w-embed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 56 56">

    <path fill="#F4EBFF" d="M48 0H8a8 8 0 0 0-8 8v40a8 8 0 0 0 8 8h40a8 8 0 0 0 8-8V8a8 8 0 0 0-8-8Z"/>
    <path stroke="#6E40D7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M32.664 16.666v-2m5.252 3.415 1.415-1.415m.013 6.667h2m-.08 6c-.668 6.738-6.353 12-13.267 12-7.363 0-13.333-5.97-13.333-13.333 0-6.914 5.262-12.599 12-13.268m1.333 7.934h5.334V28m-.507-5.334C29.684 27.104 24.513 30 18.664 30c-1.337 0-2.639-.152-3.89-.438"/>

</svg></div><h3 class="text-large-20 text-dark text-semibold margin-top _32px">Your Entire Pipeline Engine In One Stack</h3><p>Infrastructure, warm-up, lead generation, sequences, personalization, replies, and booked meetings all happen in one connected environment. No duct-taped tools. No broken integrations. No juggling vendors. You log in, plug in your infrastructure, and the system is ready to run - whether you handle outreach yourself, let Agent Frank take over, or combine both.</p></div></div><div class="why-us-bg-image w-embed"><svg viewBox="0 0 1310 740" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
