</svg></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section-comparison-faq"><div class="padding-global"><div class="container-large"><div class="pricing-faq-parent-wrapper"><div class="heading-wrapper faq-box"><div class="heading-badge-box"><h2 class="heading-style-h3 margin-top _12px">Frequently asked questions</h2></div><div class="text-medium-18">If we don’t answer your question below, please contact us via chat</div></div><div class="pricfng-aq-list-wrapper"><div class="faq-list"><div class="faq-item pricing"><div class="faq-item-divider-to-grow"></div><div data-w-id="e03c275c-6359-4e21-1844-dea23084c2ab" class="pricing-faq-wrap"><div class="pricing-faq-question-wrap"><h3 class="text-medium-18 text-dark text-semibold">Do I need to use all the products or can I just use one of them?</h3><div class="plus-wrap"><div class="plus-horizontal"></div><div class="plus-vertical"></div></div></div><div class="pricing-faq-answer-wrap"><div class="answer w-richtext"><p>You can use any combination of the Forge products as you see fit. Of course, if you choose to use the Forge exclusively, it will make running your outreach easier, because everything will be managed from one place. It’s very common among our customers to start using one of the products and then move on to integrating the other ones into their outreach stack.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="faq-item pricing"><div class="faq-item-divider-to-grow"></div><div data-w-id="e03c275c-6359-4e21-1844-dea23084c2bb" class="pricing-faq-wrap"><div class="pricing-faq-question-wrap"><h3 class="text-medium-18 text-dark text-semibold">Will the Forge work with my other tools?</h3><div class="plus-wrap"><div class="plus-horizontal"></div><div class="plus-vertical"></div></div></div><div class="pricing-faq-answer-wrap"><div class="answer w-richtext"><p>Of course! Each of our products has a comprehensive list of integrations ranging from CRMs to messaging apps like Slack. We also offer API for Salesforge and Infraforge to allow for virtually unlimited integrations.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="faq-item pricing"><div class="faq-item-divider-to-grow"></div><div data-w-id="e03c275c-6359-4e21-1844-dea23084c2cb" class="pricing-faq-wrap"><div class="pricing-faq-question-wrap"><h3 class="text-medium-18 text-dark text-semibold">Do I need separate subscriptions for each product?</h3><div class="plus-wrap"><div class="plus-horizontal"></div><div class="plus-vertical"></div></div></div><div class="pricing-faq-answer-wrap"><div class="answer w-richtext"><p>In order to provide the most flexibility, you need to have a separate subscription for each product. We understand that it may inconvenience some, however, billing for our products is mostly based on the use of resources (domains, mailboxes, contacts, processes etc.). That way you can ensure you only pay for what you need within each area: prospecting, email &amp; LinkedIn volume, domains and mailboxes.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="faq-item pricing"><div class="faq-item-divider-to-grow"></div><div data-w-id="e03c275c-6359-4e21-1844-dea23084c2db" class="pricing-faq-wrap"><div class="pricing-faq-question-wrap"><h3 class="text-medium-18 text-dark text-semibold">Do I need to open each app in a separate window?</h3><div class="plus-wrap"><div class="plus-horizontal"></div><div class="plus-vertical"></div></div></div><div class="pricing-faq-answer-wrap"><div class="answer w-richtext"><p>Of course not! You can keep each product open in a separate window or tab if you wish to, however, you can also easily switch between products after logging in.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="faq-item pricing"><div class="faq-item-divider-to-grow"></div><div data-w-id="e03c275c-6359-4e21-1844-dea23084c2eb" class="pricing-faq-wrap"><div class="pricing-faq-question-wrap"><h3 class="text-medium-18 text-dark text-semibold">Can I easily migrate from other tools to the Forge?</h3><div class="plus-wrap"><div class="plus-horizontal"></div><div class="plus-vertical"></div></div></div><div class="pricing-faq-answer-wrap"><div class="answer w-richtext"><p>Yes! Our products are extremely easy to set up and allow you to migrate data from other tools as well. From contact lists to domains - you can migrate all of it quickly and efficiently. If you need help with moving to the Forge, reach out to our support team, they will be happy to help!</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section></div><div data-w-id="c69230ae-a915-77e4-b729-df6376b63f93"><footer class="v-footer"><div class="v-footer-squares bottom w-embed"><svg viewBox="0 0 1174 224" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<g clip-path="url(#clip0_4014_3270)">
<mask id="mask0_4014_3270" style="mask-type:alpha" maskUnits="userSpaceOnUse" x="0" y="0" width="1174" height="1143">
<rect y="1142.57" width="1142.57" height="1174" transform="rotate(-90 0 1142.57)" fill="url(#paint0_radial_4014_3270)"/>
</mask>
